NEW: FOUND two reproducible defects.

1. The hook allows a mutating RPC when `list` or `describe` appears as any argument, for example `-authority describe …/setMicrophoneState`. Fix: allow only controller targets without `/`; deny every `EmulatorController/<method>` target. Add this bypass as a deny test.

2. The ASCII-only normalizer wrongly refuses exact non-Latin sentences, such as `Привет мир`. Fix both harness and benchmark tokenizers with Unicode normalization and tokens:
`re.findall(r"[^\W_]+", unicodedata.normalize("NFKC", text or "").casefold())`.
Add a non-Latin acceptance test.

